From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: matthane <matthan.evans@icloud.com>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 16:18:32 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] Amlogic-ce: drop the amvideocap driver from the linux config

The amvideocap driver is removed from common_drivers. Its config
option no longer exists.
---
 projects/Amlogic-ce/devices/Amlogic-no/linux/linux.aarch64.conf | 1 -
 1 file changed, 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/projects/Amlogic-ce/devices/Amlogic-no/linux/linux.aarch64.conf b/projects/Amlogic-ce/devices/Amlogic-no/linux/linux.aarch64.conf
--- a/projects/Amlogic-ce/devices/Amlogic-no/linux/linux.aarch64.conf
+++ b/projects/Amlogic-ce/devices/Amlogic-no/linux/linux.aarch64.conf
@@ -0,7 +0,6 @@
 # Amlogic Video Sink Driver Support
 #
 CONFIG_AMLOGIC_MEDIA_VIDEO=y
-CONFIG_AMLOGIC_MEDIA_VIDEOCAPTURE=y
 # CONFIG_AMLOGIC_MEDIA_DUMMY_PROVIDER is not set
 # end of Amlogic Video Sink Driver Support
 
